{"id":"preprod-en-current-division-programs-002","query":"What are MBZUAI's two research divisions, and which academic programs does each cover?","query_type":"synthesis","language":"English","source_type":"webpage","no_answer":false,"reference_answer":"MBZUAI has two research divisions. The Division of Biological and Life Sciences covers the M.Sc. and Ph.D. in Computational Biology. The Division of Computing and Mathematical Sciences covers undergraduate AI, the professional Master in Applied Artificial Intelligence, and programs in Computer Science, Computer Vision, Human-Computer Interaction, Machine Learning, Natural Language Processing, Robotics, and Statistics and Data Science. The site separately lists a Division of Undergraduate Studies.","gold_chunk_ids":["chunk:c650:document-revision:eec8534b53dd22ae278372b8:00001:6cb0804b2ecc","chunk:c650:document-revision:eec8534b53dd22ae278372b8:00002:eedc66c5b70a","chunk:c650:document-revision:5376742b04946f6693a10379:00009:5e6633def51e","chunk:c650:document-revision:650ffd24b7af17c9072297b5:00014:b9c967158b10"],"gold_span_ids":[],"gold_parent_ids":["parent:c650:document-revision:eec8534b53dd22ae278372b8:page","parent:c650:document-revision:5376742b04946f6693a10379:page","parent:c650:document-revision:650ffd24b7af17c9072297b5:page"],"gold_media_ids":[],"gold_document_revision_ids":["document-revision:eec8534b53dd22ae278372b8","document-revision:5376742b04946f6693a10379","document-revision:650ffd24b7af17c9072297b5"],"gold_page_card_ids":["page-card:78bf8836f8b0b3db4f69bb4e","page-card:dcb9b77e238385b94a3a0f88","page-card:2d8453f110dc78e4cdaec026"],"gold_section_ids":["page-section:4b918e31b2f9061cda62e65f","page-section:a4ae01507d5075390e4a6159","page-section:317f07a64117461cea800b7a","page-section:dfc52c4658e13207dbb20d18"],"gold_action_ids":[],"notes":"Regression for graph-expanded division-to-program mapping without query-specific answer rules.","metadata":{"benchmark_tags":["mbzuai_preprod_current_v1","source_ground