arch divisions","program families under each division","Undergraduate Studies is separately listed"],"expected_followup_topics":[],"expected_suggested_actions":[],"source_hosts":["preprod.mbzuai.ac.ae"],"source_languages":["English"],"source_keys":["chunk:c650:document-revision:5376742b04946f6693a10379:00009:5e6633def51e","chunk:c650:document-revision:650ffd24b7af17c9072297b5:00014:b9c967158b10"],"candidate_independent_gold":true,"split":"regression"}}
{"id":"preprod-en-current-msc-scholarship-003","query":"What scholarship support do MBZUAI master's students receive, and is the Master in Applied Artificial Intelligence included?","query_type":"synthesis","language":"English","source_type":"webpage","no_answer":false,"reference_answer":"Except for the Master in Applied Artificial Intelligence (MAAI), MBZUAI's M.Sc. programs offer a full scholarship that includes tuition, accommodation, healthcare, a student visa, and a generous monthly stipend. The MAAI exception should be stated explicitly rather than implying that every master's program has this package.","gold_chunk_ids":["chunk:c650:document-revision:18825836c2d1bb8cac0389be:00001:21d37bbf3baf"],"gold_span_ids":[],"gold_parent_ids":["parent:c650:document-revision:18825836c2d1bb8cac0389be:page"],"gold_media_ids":[],"gold_document_revision_ids":["document-revision:18825836c2d1bb8cac0389be"],"gold_page_card_ids":["page-card:8add10d83372679088b2b802"],"gold_section_ids":["page-section:ed01fa39e0e280ad7b90ca95"],"gold_action_ids":[],"notes":"Regression for partial scholarship answers and omission of the MAAI exception.","metadata":{"benchmark_tags":["mbzuai_preprod_current_v1","source_grounded","current_content","synthesis","regression","answer_completeness","scholarship"],"release_suite":"mbzuai_preprod_answer_completeness_v1","prompt_revision":"mbzuai-preprod-answer-completeness-20260904","scenario":"masters-scholarship-benefits-and-exception","difficulty":"medium","evidence_quotes":[{"source_key":"chunk:c650:document-revision:18825836c2d1bb8cac0389be:00001:21d37bbf3baf","quote":"Except for the Master in Applied Artificial Intelligence, all M.Sc. programs offer a full scholarship including tuition, accommodation, healthcare, student visa, and a generous monthly stipend."}],"expected_reference_urls":["https://preprod.mbzuai.ac.ae/study/msc-programs"],"expected_citation_urls":["https://preprod.mbzuai.ac.ae/study/msc-programs"],"required_pages":["https://preprod.mbzuai.ac.ae/study/msc-programs"],"min_distinct_sources":1,"answer_must_include":["Master in Applied Artificial Intelligence","tuition","accommodation","healthcare","student visa","monthly stipend"],"answer_must_not_include":["all master's programs include MAAI","2021 catalogue"],"answer_should_cover":["MAAI is excluded from this full-scholarship statement","all five listed benefits"],"expected_followup_topics":[],"expected_suggested_actions":[],"source_hosts":["preprod.mbzuai.ac.ae"],"source_languages":["English"],"source_keys":["chunk:c650:document-revision:18825836c2d1bb8cac0389be:00001:21d37bbf3baf"],"candidate_independent_gold":true,"split":"regression","answer_must_include_any_groups":[["Except for","excluding","does not include"]]}}
{"id":"preprod-en-current-msc-ml-admissions-004","query":"I'm applying to the M.Sc. in Machine Learning. Give me a detailed checklist of the admission requirements and process, including degree and GPA, English tests, documents, referees, GRE, screening or interview, fees, and key dates.","query_type":"synthesis","language":"English","source_type":"webpage","no_answer":false,"reference_answer":"For the M.Sc. in Machine Learning, applicants need a recognized STEM bachelor's degree with at least a 3.0/4.0 CGPA or equivalent. GRE is optional but a plus. M.Sc. applicants nominate at least two referees: an academic instructor/advisor and a current or former work supervisor. Applicants whose first language is not English normally need valid proof such as IELTS Academic 6.5, TOEFL iBT 90, PTE 60, Cambridge C1 180, Cambridge C2 200, or Duolingo 120, subject to the stated waiver and test-center rules. The application includes the online form, CV, degree transcript/certificate or expected-graduation letter, recommendations, statement of purpose, passport and photo, plus residency/national documents where applicable. A screening exam is offered after submission and selected applicants may be interviewed. The AED 200 fee is due after the screening exam, with the stated 75% score waiver or reimbursement on enrollment. The current page lists a 15 December 2026 application deadline, decisions by 31 March 2027, and an offer response deadline of 15 April 2027.","gold_chunk_ids":["chunk:c650:document-revision:f97e51f4f628bdd6f914a4c1:00010:9602c08ff1ed","chunk:c650:document-revision:f97e51f4f628bdd6f914a4c1:00011:b1515add2d70","chunk:c650:document-revision:f97e51f4f628bdd6f914a4c1:00012:e2c592539cf5","chunk:c650:document-revision:f97e51f4f628bdd6f914a4c1:00013:d466d36cc6cc","chunk:c650:document-revision:f97e51f4f628bdd6f914a4c1:00015:ad12e7ad3652","chunk:c650:document-revision:af54e56ba52d0b8d0bd21098:00051:415ebf48a70a","chunk:c650:document-revision:af54e56ba52d0b8d0bd21098:00052:813dda249e98","chunk:c650:document-revision:af54e56ba52d0b8d0bd21098:00053:3c3aeaed4acf","chunk:c650:document-revision:af54e56ba52d0b8d0bd21098:00054:78d64b8b7424","chunk:c650:document-revision:af54e56ba52d0b8d0bd21098:00055:3b0f7a718e9b","chunk:c650:document-revision:af54e56ba52d0b8d0bd21098:00057:2c55b04af499","chunk:c650:document-revision:af54e56ba52d0b8d0bd21098:00058:3349deb37efe","chunk:c650:document-revision:af54e56ba52d0b8d0bd21098:00059:cd32a8592fed"],"gold_span_ids":[],"gold_parent_ids":["parent:c650:document-revision:f97e51f4f628bdd6f914a4c1:page","parent:c650:document-revision:af54e56ba52d0b8d0bd21098:page"],"gold_media_ids":[],"gold_document_revision_ids":["document-revision:f97e51f4f628bdd6f914a4c1","document-revision:af54e56ba52d0b8d0bd21098"],"gold_page_card_ids":["page-card:cc408ca9b40588d82459590e","page-card:74acf533b0ea86d91a13ea8b"],"gold_section_ids":[],"gold_action_ids":[],"notes":"Regression for broad multi-facet admissions questions that previously returned only a partial answer because collapsed SPA sections were missing.","metadata":{"benchmark_tags":["mbzuai_preprod_current_v1","source_grounded","current_content","synthesis","regression","answer_completeness","admissions","multi_page"],"release_suite":"mbzuai_preprod_answer_completeness_v1","prompt_revision":"mbzuai-preprod-answer-completeness-20260904","scenario":"msc-machine-learning-complete-admissions-checklist","difficulty":"hard","evidence_quotes":[{"source_key":"chunk:c650:document-revision:af54e56ba52d0b8d0bd21098:00051:415ebf48a70a","quote":"minimum CGPA of 3.0 (on a 4.0 scale) or equivalent"},{"source_key":"chunk:c650:document-revision:af54e56ba52d0b8d0bd21098:00052:813dda249e98","quote":"Submission of GRE scores is optional"},{"source_key":"chunk:c650:document-revision:af54e56ba52d0b8d0bd21098:00055:3b0f7a718e9b","quote":"IELTS Academic: 6.5"},{"source_key":"chunk:c650:document-revision:f97e51f4f628bdd6f914a4c1:00010:9602c08ff1ed","quote":"General required documents"},{"source_key":"chunk:c650:document-revision:f97e51f4f628bdd6f914a4c1:00013:d466d36cc6cc","quote":"A subset of applicants will be invited to a technical interview"}],"expected_reference_urls":["https://preprod.mbzuai.ac.ae/graduate-masters-admissions","https://preprod.mbzuai.ac.ae/study/msc-programs/masters-in-machine-learning"],"expected_citation_urls":["https://preprod.mbzuai.ac.ae/graduate-masters-admissions","https://preprod.mbzuai.ac.ae/study/msc-programs/masters-in-machine-learning"],"required_pages":["https://preprod.mbzuai.ac.ae/graduate-masters-admissions","https://preprod.mbzuai.ac.ae/study/msc-programs/masters-in-machine-learning"],"min_distinct_sources":2,"answer_must_include":["3.0","IELTS","TOEFL","two","GRE","screening exam","interview","AED 200","15 December 2026","31 March 2027","15 April 2027"],"answer_must_not_include":["GRE is mandatory","admission is guaranteed","2021 catalogue","2022 catalogue"],"answer_should_cover":["recognized STEM degree","English-language alternatives and validity rules","required application documents","two referee roles","optional GRE","screening and interview","fee and waiver conditions","application and decision dates"],"expected_followup_topics":[],"expected_suggested_actions":[],"source_hosts":["preprod.mbzuai.ac.ae"],"source_languages":["English"],"source_keys":["parent:c650:document-revision:f97e51f4f628bdd6f914a4c1:page","parent:c650:document-revision:af54e56ba52d0b8d0bd21098:page"],"candidate_independent_gold":true,"split":"regression"}}
{"id":"preprod-ar-current-msc-ml-admissions-005","query":"أريد التقديم على ماجستير تعلم الآلة. أعطني قائمة مفصلة وكاملة بمتطلبات وخطوات القبول، بما فيها المؤهل والمعدل، اختبارات اللغة، الوثائق، التوصيات، GRE، اختبار الفرز أو المقابلة، الرسوم، والمواعيد المهمة.","query_type":"synthesis","language":"Arabic","source_type":"webpage","no_answer":false,"reference_answer":"يتطلب برنامج ماجستير تعلم الآلة بكالوريوس معترفًا به في تخصص STEM وبمعدل تراكمي لا يقل عن 3.0 من 4 أو ما يعادله. اختبار GRE اختياري لكنه يُعد ميزة. يحتاج متقدم الماجستير إلى مرجعين على الأقل، أحدهما أكاديمي والآخر مشرف عمل حالي أو سابق. ولمن ليست الإنجليزية لغته الأولى، تشمل الحدود المنشورة IELTS Academic بدرجة 6.5 أو TOEFL iBT بدرجة 90، مع بدائل PTE وCambridge وDuolingo وشروط الإعفاء والصلاحية المبينة في الصفحة. تشمل الوثائق نموذج الطلب والسيرة الذاتية والشهادة وكشف الدرجات أو خطاب التخرج المتوقع والتوصيات وبيان الغرض وجواز السفر والصورة ووثائق الإقامة أو الجنسية عند انطباقها. بعد التقديم يوجد اختبار فرز، وقد تُدعى مجموعة مختارة إلى مقابلة. الرسم 200 درهم بعد اختبار الفرز، مع إعفاء لمن يحقق 75% فأكثر أو استرداد عند الالتحاق. الموعد النهائي المنشور هو 15 ديسمبر 2026، وقرار القبول بحلول 31 مارس 2027، والرد على العرض حتى 15 أبريل 2027.","gold_chunk_ids":["chunk:c650:document-revision:f97e51f4f628bdd6f914a4c1:00010:9602c08ff1ed","chunk:c650:document-revision:f97e51f4f628bdd6f914a4c1:00011:b1515add2d70","chunk:c650:document-revision:f97e51f4f628bdd6f914a4c1:00012:e2c592539cf5","chunk:c650:document-revision:f97e51f4f628bdd6f914a4c1:00013:d466d36cc6cc","chunk:c650:document-revision:f97e51f4f628bdd6f914a4c1:00015:ad12e7ad3652","chunk:c650:document-revision:af54e56ba52d0b8d0bd21098:00051:415ebf48a70a","chunk:c650:document-revision:af54e56ba52d0b8d0bd21098:00052:813dda249e98","chunk:c650:document-revision:af54e56ba52d0b8d0bd21098:00053:3c3aeaed4acf","chunk:c650:document-revision:af54e56ba52d0b8d0bd21098:00054:78d64b8b7424","chunk:c650:document-revision:af54e56ba52d0b8d0bd21098:00055:3b0f7a718e9b","chunk:c650:docu